INE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 지원자격</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 본교 재학생으로서 2개 학기 이상 이수하고 다음 각 호의 요건에 해당되는 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 가. 이수성적 평점평균이 3.0이상인 학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 수학기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 2013. 9. 2(월) ~ 12. 13(금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; - 1개 학기 단위로 수학(졸업까지 타대학에서 2개 학기 이내로 수학 가능) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 신청기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013. 07. 15(월)~18(목)[4일간]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 신청장소 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 제출서류</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 가. 타대학수학신청원(붙임서식) 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 성적증명서 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 신청학점</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 12학점 이내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;※ 타대학 수학 신청시 유의사항 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음(재수강 불가)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 등 록 금</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 금오공과대학교 등록일정에 맞추어 납부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 07.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
